unresolved questions about elite privacy, vice enforcement, and selective exposure.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>1 May 2008</span><span>Tarpon Springs, Florida, United States</span><span>Suicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-deborah-jeane-palfrey.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-deborah-jeane-palfrey.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="bruce-ivins"><span class="label">2008 · Scientist · Suicide</span><h3>Bruce Ivins</h3><p>Ivins was the primary federal suspect in the 2001 anthrax-letter attacks and had deep access to biodefense laboratories and evidence. His death prevented a trial and left the anthrax case dependent on an investigative narrative rather than adversarial testing.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>29 Jul 2008</span><span>Frederick, Maryland, United States</span><span>Suicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-bruce-ivins.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-bruce-ivins.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="michael-connell"><span class="label">2008 · Technology consultant · Aircraft crash</span><h3>Michael Connell</h3><p>Connell worked on election technology, political websites, and systems involved in contested voting and data-management claims. His death became a key case in electronic-election conspiracy narratives.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>19 Dec 2008</span><span>Akron, Ohio, United States</span><span>Accident</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-michael-connell.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-michael-connell.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Year Pattern Boundary</h2><article class="card"><p>Shared dates, institutions, investigators, lawyers, beneficiaries, or security failures are leads for comparison. A pattern does not establish coordination.</p></article></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-07-31","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>THE DEATH FILES</strong> — evidence first, conclusion second.</p><p class="warning">Inclusion does not imply murder, conspiracy, or wrongdoing by any connected person. Official findings, established evidence, disputed claims, analytical inference, and speculation are displayed separately.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script src="death-files.js"></script><script src="investigation-pulse.js"></script></body></html>